codex
The structured post-state exposed why a bare existential was insufficient: K does not simplify frame deletion enough to forget the loop variable under the map update. I’m strengthening the invariant with a truthful structural summary `lastVisited(remaining, old, t)`. It records the exact final `e` binding—old value on empty input, current element on failure, recursively last visited on success—so the fixed scope transition is machine-checkable without any map lemma.
apply patch
